WEBVTT

01:28.429 --> 01:35.090
Our Secret
EP11

01:40.690 --> 01:41.690
Let me tell you something.

01:42.330 --> 01:43.480
Our city will hold a painting competition

01:43.690 --> 01:45.240
a few days later,

01:45.600 --> 01:48.240
which requires each school to recommend several students to participate.

01:48.690 --> 01:50.369
If you wanna sign up,

01:50.369 --> 01:50.920
Kong Shadi

01:50.970 --> 01:53.010
just come here now to get the registration form.

01:54.160 --> 01:55.880
Sir, Ding Xian can do it.

01:57.200 --> 01:58.649
Yes, she can.

01:58.649 --> 01:59.970
Sir, she can.

02:05.200 --> 02:05.920
Here you are.

02:08.480 --> 02:09.330
Ding Xian,

02:09.640 --> 02:10.600
Can you do it?

02:26.210 --> 02:27.000
Mom

02:28.130 --> 02:30.080
How do you think about it?

02:33.850 --> 02:34.770
It's quite good.

02:35.570 --> 02:36.640
But

02:36.880 --> 02:38.969
you are now in the second semester of high school.

02:39.360 --> 02:41.640
If it were any other time, I would definitely allow you to do it.

02:42.000 --> 02:43.969
But now is the critical time.

02:44.640 --> 02:46.690
You must focus on your study.

02:47.440 --> 02:50.160
Painting is just one of your hobbies.

02:50.850 --> 02:52.719
Don't pay much attention to it.

02:54.360 --> 02:55.130
OK.

02:59.210 --> 03:00.130
Ding Xian,

03:00.520 --> 03:01.720
I'm talking to you.

03:01.880 --> 03:03.520
Don't give me that deep freeze.

03:04.690 --> 03:06.210
You wouldn't agree anyway.

03:06.410 --> 03:08.050
You talk to me in this attitude?

03:08.410 --> 03:09.570
I do it all for your own good.

03:09.640 --> 03:11.050
I won't be bad to you.

03:18.050 --> 03:19.969
Mom, water cures anger.

03:26.770 --> 03:27.690
Show me

03:28.330 --> 03:29.290
your composition.

03:45.330 --> 03:46.520
My family.

03:50.770 --> 03:53.000
It's always noisy at home.

03:53.410 --> 03:55.080
My mother is very similar to my sister.

03:55.330 --> 03:56.440
They often get angry.

03:56.770 --> 03:57.930
When something goes wrong with them,

03:58.130 --> 03:59.440
they will speak very loudly,

03:59.600 --> 04:00.330
loudly enough

04:00.440 --> 04:01.410
to wake the dead.

04:04.360 --> 04:06.440
That's what I am in your mind?

04:08.000 --> 04:09.290
Speak loudly enough to wake the dead.

04:09.640 --> 04:11.130
Good idiom.

04:11.640 --> 04:12.600
Rewrite.

04:17.169 --> 04:19.520
Why wouldn't she let me tell the truth?

04:21.479 --> 04:22.320
Dad

04:22.640 --> 04:24.320
I don't wanna get married in the future.

04:24.970 --> 04:26.010
Hey, little boy.

04:28.010 --> 04:28.890
I understand you.

04:30.200 --> 04:31.970
Go rewrite it.

04:44.450 --> 04:45.970
Don't hesitate.

04:46.640 --> 04:48.850
Let me accompany you to sign up.

04:50.040 --> 04:51.040
What's going on?

04:52.040 --> 04:53.240
Please persuade her.

04:53.480 --> 04:55.450
She doesn't wanna sign up for the painting competition.

04:57.970 --> 05:00.240
I heard that Yang Chunzi also signed up.

05:01.040 --> 05:02.040
Come on Little Monster.

05:02.080 --> 05:03.170
Don't be afraid.

05:03.480 --> 05:04.730
It is always good to participate.

05:05.290 --> 05:07.890
Forget it, let me think again.

05:08.320 --> 05:09.640
The class is about to start.

05:10.760 --> 05:11.890
Don't be afraid.

05:15.970 --> 05:16.800
Sit down.

05:30.320 --> 05:32.570
Dad, why are you dressed like this?

05:33.730 --> 05:35.360
I'm awesome this time.

05:35.640 --> 05:36.610
Let me tell you.

05:36.850 --> 05:38.640
Just play it by ear later.

05:38.920 --> 05:39.690
Ding Wencheng

05:40.080 --> 05:41.130
Does this look good on me?

05:42.200 --> 05:43.730
Yes, you look good.

05:44.970 --> 05:45.320
Well.

05:45.320 --> 05:46.320
Is my lipstick too red?

05:46.610 --> 05:48.320
Too red? No.

05:48.520 --> 05:49.480
Xianxian,

05:49.640 --> 05:50.570
do you think she is good-looking?

05:52.080 --> 05:53.010
Yes.

05:53.360 --> 05:54.130
Mom

05:54.290 --> 05:55.850
You look good in this lipstick.

05:57.010 --> 05:58.570
You are so beautiful today.

05:58.850 --> 06:00.040
Where are you going?

06:00.240 --> 06:01.920
Your dad follows the fashion.

06:02.130 --> 06:04.450
He'll take me to the concert and eat western food.

06:04.640 --> 06:06.920
I have never been to such a place.

06:07.010 --> 06:08.290
We should also enjoy

06:08.360 --> 06:10.360
the elegant life from time to time.

06:10.760 --> 06:12.850
So I will cultivate our taste

06:13.040 --> 06:14.850
with your mother and Congcong.

06:15.040 --> 06:15.890
Good habits need to be developed

06:16.010 --> 06:17.570
from an early age.

06:18.200 --> 06:20.450
Xianxian, you just stay at home.

06:20.760 --> 06:22.730
Don't worry, I'm not a child either.

06:22.730 --> 06:23.290
Well.

06:24.040 --> 06:25.010
Ding Juncong

06:25.200 --> 06:26.520
Ding Juncong, hurry up.

06:28.970 --> 06:30.760
Congcong, come here.

06:30.800 --> 06:31.690
Let's go.

06:32.730 --> 06:33.360
What's wrong with you?

06:33.640 --> 06:34.690
What are you doing?

06:36.240 --> 06:37.130
What's the matter?

06:37.520 --> 06:38.360
I refuse to be with you.

06:38.570 --> 06:39.850
I wanna watch cartoons at home.

06:40.010 --> 06:41.410
Watch cartoons?

06:41.570 --> 06:42.450
Don't be a good-for-nothing boy.

06:42.640 --> 06:43.920
It's not easy for your dad to get tickets.

06:44.040 --> 06:45.610
Right, these tickets are very expensive.

06:45.799 --> 06:47.080
You must come with us.

06:47.570 --> 06:49.040
Right, the concert is so good.

06:49.200 --> 06:50.730
If I don't need to do my homework at home,

06:50.760 --> 06:52.730
I'll also like to go. So you go.

06:53.200 --> 06:54.970
That's your business. I won't go anyway.

06:55.200 --> 06:57.010
Then stay at home!

06:58.640 --> 06:59.890
Ding Xian, take care of him.

07:00.080 --> 07:01.690
Let him do his homework, and I'll check when I come back.

07:02.240 --> 07:03.760
Let's go.

07:06.040 --> 07:06.920
Dad

07:08.690 --> 07:10.610
That's all I can do for you.

07:10.760 --> 07:11.610
Ding Wencheng

07:11.850 --> 07:12.640
Hurry up.

07:23.320 --> 07:24.240
Hello.

07:24.920 --> 07:25.850
Come on.

07:26.040 --> 07:27.130
Let me take you to the venue.

07:27.920 --> 07:29.320
I may not be able to go.

07:31.450 --> 07:33.040
Why?

07:34.610 --> 07:35.450
OK.

07:41.320 --> 07:42.170
Hello.

07:42.730 --> 07:44.290
You two come here now.

07:51.640 --> 07:52.520
Would you like some?

07:53.170 --> 07:54.130
Put it there.

07:54.730 --> 07:55.450
OK.

07:59.360 --> 08:00.320
Juncong

08:01.410 --> 08:02.890
It's such a fine day today.

08:03.080 --> 08:04.320
Won't you go out?

08:04.730 --> 08:05.640
I don't want to.

08:06.920 --> 08:08.640
It's rare that mom and dad are not home.

08:09.240 --> 08:10.320
You wanted to

08:10.480 --> 08:12.610
go to that game center just the other day, right?

08:13.240 --> 08:14.130
You can go there.

08:14.320 --> 08:15.570
I'll keep your secret.

08:16.320 --> 08:18.360
Don't think I don't know what you want.

08:18.970 --> 08:19.970
I'm not going.

08:20.080 --> 08:21.890
I just wanna piss you off.

08:32.290 --> 08:33.439
Why are you here?

08:33.730 --> 08:35.080
Let us help you take care of your brother.

08:35.290 --> 08:37.080
You just feel free to participate in the competition.

08:37.370 --> 08:38.640
I'm King of Children of Shen Hai High School.

08:38.880 --> 08:40.370
Don't worry.

08:40.490 --> 08:41.730
My brother is very...

08:41.970 --> 08:43.809
Don't hesitate. Get ready.

08:43.929 --> 08:44.970
-My Brother...  -Go.

08:45.640 --> 08:46.320
Hurry up.

08:49.680 --> 08:50.490
Hello bro.

08:51.520 --> 08:52.440
Let me

08:52.970 --> 08:54.410
stay with you today, okay?

09:00.200 --> 09:01.050
What are you doing?

09:01.610 --> 09:02.490
Don't look.

09:03.560 --> 09:04.320
Oh, little boy.

09:05.120 --> 09:06.560
Why can't I take a look?

09:09.000 --> 09:11.760
What are you doing?

09:11.970 --> 09:13.370
Show me, will you?

09:13.520 --> 09:14.520
OK.

09:14.730 --> 09:17.120
Let me stay with you today, okay?

09:17.290 --> 09:18.080
OK.

09:18.810 --> 09:19.880
So can you teach me

09:19.880 --> 09:21.080
how to play this game?

09:21.490 --> 09:22.410
OK.

09:22.930 --> 09:24.560
This is my favorite game.

09:24.850 --> 09:26.080
Wenwen is the little flying flag.

09:30.850 --> 09:32.170
This is Jiang Chen's motorcycle, right?

09:32.730 --> 09:33.730
Come on.

09:35.290 --> 09:36.320
Please wear the helmet.

09:38.490 --> 09:39.520
Are you ready?

09:41.440 --> 09:43.080
The great escape.

09:48.370 --> 09:49.250
Where's my motorcycle?

10:02.000 --> 10:02.850
Jiang Chen

10:03.760 --> 10:04.730
You're going to

10:05.000 --> 10:07.200
take me for a ride on this bike?

10:09.810 --> 10:10.810
Yes.

10:12.560 --> 10:13.370
Look,

10:13.730 --> 10:14.810
it's a lovely day.

10:15.680 --> 10:17.370
This beautiful bike

10:17.760 --> 10:18.640
suits you very well.

10:20.610 --> 10:21.490
Come on.

10:21.680 --> 10:23.490
No, it's a shame.

10:24.410 --> 10:26.320
You have a really good appearance.

10:26.490 --> 10:27.760
But why are you so melodramatic?

10:28.250 --> 10:29.320
Come on.

10:29.610 --> 10:30.930
Or I'll leave.

10:32.170 --> 10:33.610
Why do you call me melodramatic?

10:33.810 --> 10:34.930
All right.

10:39.490 --> 10:40.560
It's too late.

10:42.120 --> 10:42.930
Do it.

10:43.080 --> 10:43.880
Goodbye.

10:50.000 --> 10:50.930
Ding Xian

10:53.200 --> 10:54.120
Go for it.

11:10.970 --> 11:12.520
The competition is in proposition mode.

11:12.850 --> 11:15.810
Please choose one of the three topics

11:16.080 --> 11:16.850
of youth, family affection and striving

11:17.000 --> 11:18.880
to draw.

11:39.050 --> 11:39.970
What did you draw?

11:41.170 --> 11:42.120
This is my secret.

11:44.120 --> 11:45.370
All right.

11:46.760 --> 11:48.730
Anyway, winning a prize

11:48.970 --> 11:50.880
won't be difficult for you.

11:52.520 --> 11:54.680
Actually, the result is not important.

11:56.850 --> 11:58.490
I suddenly understood what you told me earlier

11:59.080 --> 12:01.520
during the competition today.

12:04.490 --> 12:05.370
You said that

12:06.250 --> 12:08.810
many seemingly ordinary things

12:10.000 --> 12:11.680
will eventually come together

12:12.520 --> 12:13.370
and

12:13.520 --> 12:15.640
have different meanings again.

12:16.680 --> 12:17.970
Now I think

12:18.490 --> 12:19.850
painting

12:20.930 --> 12:22.520
is not just a hobby

12:22.560 --> 12:23.520
for me.

12:26.120 --> 12:27.050
Anyway,

12:28.490 --> 12:29.730
thank you today.

12:38.080 --> 12:39.080
Release.

12:40.850 --> 12:42.080
Spike score.

12:42.290 --> 12:44.320
Ding Juncong, add five points, victory.

12:44.520 --> 12:45.520
Defeat.

12:50.320 --> 12:51.410
Ding Juncong

12:52.520 --> 12:53.680
He is not a schoolboy,

12:53.850 --> 12:55.760
but a demon child definitely.

12:56.410 --> 12:57.970
I don't care. Do my homework for me.

12:58.120 --> 13:00.250
Otherwise, I will tell mother about it.

13:00.610 --> 13:01.520
Mom.

13:02.080 --> 13:03.250
What time is it now?

13:07.610 --> 13:08.320
I'm done.

13:08.560 --> 13:09.810
My mother will be back soon.

13:10.880 --> 13:11.810
What should I do?

13:14.730 --> 13:15.730
Let me help you with your homework.

13:16.200 --> 13:17.520
Clean up quickly.

13:21.320 --> 13:22.810
-Which one?  -This.

13:39.640 --> 13:40.680
Why are there so many people?

13:41.560 --> 13:43.050
Hello, aunt and uncle.

13:43.850 --> 13:44.970
You guys...

13:46.200 --> 13:47.850
We are a study group.

13:48.290 --> 13:50.610
Zhou Siyue is teaching Juncong to do his homework.

13:51.000 --> 13:51.850
Right.

13:52.810 --> 13:54.050
That's nice.

13:54.440 --> 13:55.760
Show me your homework.

14:04.080 --> 14:04.970
Not bad.

14:05.610 --> 14:06.640
You finished your homework very well today.

14:08.640 --> 14:10.000
How did you solve this problem?

14:15.730 --> 14:16.760
This...

14:17.050 --> 14:19.250
Didn't Zhou Siyue teach you just now?

14:19.520 --> 14:20.250
This...

14:20.490 --> 14:21.370
You forgot?

14:25.520 --> 14:26.880
I know you.

14:27.640 --> 14:28.640
So many

14:28.850 --> 14:30.170
brothers and sisters tutor you.

14:30.520 --> 14:31.640
Why don't you seize the opportunity

14:31.810 --> 14:33.200
to learn from them?

14:33.610 --> 14:34.640
Copy this question

14:34.810 --> 14:35.760
into the notebook

14:35.930 --> 14:36.880
and do it again later.

14:38.080 --> 14:38.970
Just stay here.

14:38.970 --> 14:40.170
I will cook for you.

14:40.320 --> 14:41.050
Wait.

14:41.440 --> 14:42.440
It doesn't matter.

14:42.680 --> 14:43.490
We gotta go.

14:43.640 --> 14:44.250
Goodbye, uncle.

14:44.410 --> 14:45.560
Goodbye, auntie.

14:45.850 --> 14:47.320
My mom called me.

14:54.490 --> 14:55.410
How is it?

15:06.050 --> 15:07.810
Be careful this week.

15:08.680 --> 15:10.290
Beware of bad guy.

15:11.000 --> 15:12.050
Who is the bad guy?

15:12.200 --> 15:13.170
Who is the bad guy?

15:16.170 --> 15:17.080
Ding Xian

15:17.320 --> 15:18.410
Just come to me.

15:21.050 --> 15:22.520
You did something wrong again?

15:23.250 --> 15:24.320
No.

15:25.120 --> 15:26.760
This is too accurate, right?

15:41.730 --> 15:42.560
How are you?

15:43.680 --> 15:44.640
He scolded you?

15:46.810 --> 15:47.880
It's all right.

15:53.880 --> 15:54.760
What the hell?

15:55.520 --> 15:57.200
Xianxian, you're wonderful.

15:57.640 --> 15:59.320
You are really a great painter.

16:00.170 --> 16:02.080
Look, Xianxian won the first place.

16:04.680 --> 16:05.930
Great job, Little Monster.

16:06.490 --> 16:07.440
You are great, Ding Xian.

16:07.440 --> 16:08.250
Give it to me.

16:10.730 --> 16:12.440
You are like crazy people.

16:13.200 --> 16:14.370
Can you guys be more mature?

16:14.520 --> 16:15.490
How are you?

16:15.730 --> 16:16.610
I'm fine.

16:41.850 --> 16:42.930
A marinated egg, please.

16:45.000 --> 16:45.760
Come on.

16:46.120 --> 16:47.200
Today is Ding Xian's treat.

16:47.200 --> 16:48.970
I will order some unordered

16:49.000 --> 16:49.810
and expensive ones.

16:50.290 --> 16:51.930
Why do you take advantage of everyone?

16:53.000 --> 16:54.290
I just wanna

16:54.440 --> 16:55.760
thank you all very much today.

16:56.370 --> 16:57.370
Without you guys,

16:57.610 --> 16:59.610
I wouldn't have been able to go to the competition.

16:59.850 --> 17:01.370
Song Ziqi is right.

17:01.640 --> 17:03.120
I'll order more too.

17:03.120 --> 17:03.810
Just do it.

17:04.290 --> 17:06.370
You've ordered so much, but you still order?

17:07.850 --> 17:08.800
I can't?

17:09.009 --> 17:10.969
You can.

17:12.249 --> 17:14.530
Can we eat it all?

17:14.770 --> 17:16.890
Are you guys that hungry?

17:17.770 --> 17:18.890
We can definitely eat it all.

17:19.320 --> 17:20.920
You're like a greedy hungry ghost.

17:21.080 --> 17:23.040
You've made me poorer by eating at my house these days.

17:29.200 --> 17:30.650
You argued with your father again?

17:31.530 --> 17:32.970
What is the reason this time?

17:33.490 --> 17:35.850
This time it's different.

17:36.040 --> 17:37.920
A little bit serious.

17:37.920 --> 17:38.890
So I just wanna...

17:39.010 --> 17:40.440
He just wants to be a soldier, but his father

17:41.080 --> 17:42.080
won't allow it.

17:42.440 --> 17:43.490
You're the only one with a mouth.

17:44.440 --> 17:46.010
You will say it sooner or later anyway.

17:51.040 --> 17:53.160
I'll order.

17:53.530 --> 17:55.200
Here's the menu.

18:08.040 --> 18:09.130
Don't talk with me.

18:10.440 --> 18:11.560
I've made up my mind.

18:14.040 --> 18:15.250
I won't advise you.

18:16.800 --> 18:19.280
You told me you wanted to be a soldier when you were eight.

18:19.920 --> 18:20.920
Have you forgotten?

18:21.250 --> 18:22.530
I told you at that time that

18:23.010 --> 18:24.280
if you were a soldier,

18:24.730 --> 18:26.440
I would engage in national defense research.

18:27.200 --> 18:28.490
This is equivalent to

18:28.680 --> 18:30.970
defending our country together.

18:35.160 --> 18:36.400
I haven't forgotten.

18:36.730 --> 18:38.400
We must not go back on our word.

18:38.970 --> 18:40.490
Keep your word.

18:40.730 --> 18:41.730
OK.

18:45.530 --> 18:46.530
Don't worry.

18:47.370 --> 18:48.530
We're with you.

18:52.130 --> 18:54.490
It seems that there is nothing to eat.

18:55.320 --> 18:56.370
Let's go back.

18:58.200 --> 18:59.610
Everyone has a dream.

18:59.890 --> 19:02.160
My dream is to be a pilot.

19:03.530 --> 19:04.650
If you wanna be a pilot,

19:04.800 --> 19:05.920
I will be a flight attendant.

19:06.200 --> 19:07.280
I wanna graduate before you.

19:07.440 --> 19:08.890
I will fly before you.

19:09.130 --> 19:10.920
Clumsy birds have to start flying early.

19:11.650 --> 19:13.010
You call me a clumsy bird?

19:13.610 --> 19:15.370
I'm a clumsy bird.

19:18.850 --> 19:20.010
What about you?

19:20.080 --> 19:21.400
What do you want to do in the future?

19:24.490 --> 19:25.730
Have you finished ordering?

19:26.850 --> 19:28.280
So I'll call the boss.

19:28.650 --> 19:29.560
Please.

19:29.970 --> 19:30.680
I'm coming.

19:33.130 --> 19:34.530
Yes, I want these.

19:35.010 --> 19:35.560
OK.

19:37.130 --> 19:38.920
Did you just order that French Toast?

19:38.920 --> 19:39.610
Yes.

19:39.680 --> 19:40.320
Yes?

19:42.650 --> 19:43.370
Right.

19:45.200 --> 19:46.280
What is

19:47.250 --> 19:48.680
my dream?

19:57.280 --> 19:59.160
His father is a soldier.

19:59.560 --> 20:01.440
Why doesn't he support Jiang Chen?

20:02.850 --> 20:03.770
Jiang Chen

20:03.890 --> 20:06.010
had a bad relationship with his father since he was a child.

20:07.370 --> 20:08.920
He doesn't always

20:09.250 --> 20:10.440
listen to his father.

20:11.010 --> 20:13.250
So his father thinks that he can't endure hardship

20:13.680 --> 20:14.680
and is not suitable for being a soldier.

20:16.080 --> 20:17.730
And you don't know Jiang Chen very well.

20:18.530 --> 20:19.560
That boy

20:20.010 --> 20:21.160
is stubborn.

20:21.440 --> 20:23.250
He is sure to stick to it.

20:29.970 --> 20:30.920
What is on your mind?

20:33.130 --> 20:35.320
I feel that you all have dreams

20:35.680 --> 20:37.040
and goals.

20:37.610 --> 20:38.770
You are great.

20:40.320 --> 20:42.370
You just won the first prize.

20:43.130 --> 20:44.440
Why do you think so much?

20:44.730 --> 20:46.650
Painting is just

20:46.730 --> 20:48.250
one of my hobbies.

20:48.490 --> 20:50.920
Dreams should

20:51.010 --> 20:52.370
be grand.

20:55.850 --> 20:57.040
All dreams

20:57.320 --> 20:59.320
begin with hobbies.

21:00.320 --> 21:01.490
And I believe

21:01.850 --> 21:03.490
you can do anything

