36:03.440 --> 36:04.840
The new semester will start the day after tomorrow.

36:06.250 --> 36:07.160
Oh.

36:08.120 --> 36:09.050
Last year.

36:09.250 --> 36:10.050
Right.

36:12.330 --> 36:13.570
Jiangsu University.

36:14.090 --> 36:14.770
