They say they are going to have a bonfire dance later.

36:46.530 --> 36:47.440
Do you want to join us?

36:49.970 --> 36:50.600
OK.

36:51.010 --> 36:52.090
The bonfire dance is great.

36:53.490 --> 36:55.090
Let's do it together.

