37:29.050 --> 37:30.970
Let's dance together.

37:31.090 --> 37:32.920
Let's dance together.

37:37.880 --> 37:38.730
How to dance?

37:41.090 --> 37:42.200
Left and right.

37:43.490 --> 37:44.250
Friends

37:45.120 --> 37:46.400
